[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0344","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0344.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0589","title":"PVote 1.0/1.5 未经授权管理密码修改漏洞","description":"PVote 1.9 之前版本（包括 1.0 和 1.5）的 ch_info.php 存在授权验证缺陷，远程未认证攻击者可直接向该脚本提交 newpass 和 confirm 参数并设置为相同的新密码，从而绕过权限控制任意修改管理员密码并获取后台特权。该漏洞攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），影响机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者仅需构造包含新密码的 HTTP 请求直接调用 ch_info.php 即可完成利用，无需任何前置条件或用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0589"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:43Z","remediation":"立即升级 PVote 至 1.9 或更高版本，该版本修复了 ch_info.php 未授权修改管理员密码的漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache/Nginx）禁止直接访问 ch_info.php，或在应用层添加权限校验，仅允许已认证的管理员会话调用该脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/268231","http://orbit-net.net:8001/php/pvote/","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8878.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4541","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21397","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0589.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0589.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0589","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0589.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0589.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/790c2d6c2f00f7f154de7420ee269c333853d9a4/2002/CVE-2002-0589.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0589.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0589.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0589.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0589.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0344.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0343","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0343.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0588","title":"PVote PVote 投票内容篡改漏洞","description":"PVote 1.0/1.5 版本存在身份认证缺失漏洞，系统未对受限操作（添加/删除投票）进行用户身份验证。远程攻击者可直接访问 add.php 和 del.php 接口并通过篡改参数，未经授权添加或删除投票内容。该漏洞影响 PVote 1.9 之前版本，攻击条件为网络可达目标 Web 应用，无需认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），主要影响数据完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0588"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:43Z","remediation":"升级 PVote 到 1.9 或更高版本，该版本修复了未授权访问 add.php 和 del.php 的漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器配置中为 add.php 和 del.php 添加访问控制（如 IP 白名单、Basic Auth 或要求有效会话），并禁用匿名用户对这两个文件的直接访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/268231","http://orbit-net.net:8001/php/pvote/","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8877.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4540","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21391","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0588.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0588.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0588","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0588.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0588.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/790c2d6c2f00f7f154de7420ee269c333853d9a4/2002/CVE-2002-0588.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0588.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0588.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0588.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0588.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0343.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0342","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0342.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0575","title":"OpenSSH OpenSSH 2.x/3.x Kerberos 4 TGT/AFS Token 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 在启用 Kerberos/AFS 支持且开启 KerberosTgtPassing 或 AFSTokenPassing 选项时，存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞影响 OpenSSH 2.9.9 之前版本及 3.2.1 之前的 3.x 版本。已通过身份认证的远程或本地攻击者可利用此漏洞执行任意代码并提升权限，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、低复杂度、无需认证、部分机密性/完整性/可用性影响。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0575"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:42Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSH 至 2.9.9 或 3.2.1 及以上版本。若无法立即升级，请编辑 /etc/ssh/sshd_config 将 KerberosTgtPassing 和 AFSTokenPassing 设为 no，并重启 sshd 服务；或在编译时禁用 Kerberos/AFS 支持（--without-kerberos --without-afs）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0298.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-04/0394.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102167972421837&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=vuln-dev&m=101924296115863&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/268718","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/269701","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8896.php","http://www.osvdb.org/781","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4560","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21402","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34a9e13075452733bcb91f2f69cce2906587662c/2002/CVE-2002-0575.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0575.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0575","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/ff3040836458101aa6063f7e3b121abc49dbffa7/CVEs/2002/CVE-2002-0575.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/003831a52157fd63351f2c9a1ee0ba9350abc5b2/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0575.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0575.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0575.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0575.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/5ed7d4ade31e30e11184c586fbedcdecf9f82568/2002/CVE-2002-0575.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0575.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0342.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0211","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0211.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0594","title":"Netscape Mozilla 浏览器 CSS LINK 元素信息泄露漏洞","description":"Netscape 6 及 Mozilla 1.0 RC1 及更早版本中存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过在层叠样式表（CSS）页面中使用 LINK 元素，该元素会触发 HTTP 重定向，从而判断客户端系统上是否存在特定文件。攻击原理是利用浏览器对 CSS 中 LINK 标签的处理机制，当引用的外部资源存在时浏览器会发起 HTTP 请求，攻击者通过观察重定向行为即可推断目标文件是否存在。该漏洞无需用户交互即可利用，攻击者仅需诱导用户访问恶意构造的网页即可探测客户端文件系统信息，可能导致敏感文件路径泄露，为进一步攻击提供信息基础。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0594"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:44Z","remediation":"升级到 Mozilla 1.0 及以上版本，或升级到 Netscape 7.0 及以上版本。Red Hat 已发布 RHSA-20