-2002-0593","title":"Netscape 6 和 Mozilla IRC URI 通道名缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Netscape 6 和 Mozilla 1.0 RC1 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长频道名称的特制 IRC URI 触发该漏洞，导致浏览器崩溃（拒绝服务），且可能在受影响系统上以用户权限执行任意代码。攻击条件为用户点击恶意链接，无需额外认证，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0593"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:44Z","remediation":"tags.<value>升级到 Mozilla 1.0 正式版或更高版本，或升级到 Netscape 6.2.3 及以上版本。对于 Conectiva Linux 用户，可安装厂商提供的安全更新补丁（公告 ID 000490）。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至现代浏览器如 Firefox 或 Chrome。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000490","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/270249","http://secunia.com/advisories/8039","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8976.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4637","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0593.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0593","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0593.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0593.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0593.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9b61e147dd97f8b10bc28655d49bf9e6a89e79e2/2002/CVE-2002-0593.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0593.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-05xx/CVE-2002-0593.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0593.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2002-0593.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0201","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0201.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0404","title":"Ethereal GIOP解析器内存消耗拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ethereal（现Wireshark）0.9.3之前版本中的GIOP（通用ORB间协议）解析器存在内存消耗拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，可通过向目标系统发送特制的GIOP协议数据包，触发解析器在处理时分配大量内存，导致系统内存资源耗尽，造成服务拒绝。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，影响Ethereal 0.9.0至0.9.3版本，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0404"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 Ethereal 至 0.9.3 或更高版本。各发行版对应补丁：Debian 安装 DSA-130 安全更新，Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2002:036/RHSA-2002:088/RHSA-2002:170 更新，Caldera OpenLinux 安装 CSSA-2002-037.0 更新。如无法升级，可在网络边界部署入侵检测规则，对 GIOP 协议流量进行深度包检测并拦截异常长度的 CORBA 请求报文，以缓解内存耗尽风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000505","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102268626526119&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-130","http://www.ethereal.com/appnotes/enpa-sa-00004.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9206.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-036.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-088.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-170.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4808","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0404.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0404","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e2322a1c7ec352a09ed3f56a28a4b08df0e6844e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0404.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0404.json"