.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0401","title":"Ethereal SMB解析器空指针解引用拒绝服务代码执行漏洞","description":"Ethereal 0.9.3 及更早版本中的 SMB 协议解析器存在空指针解引用漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的畸形网络数据包，触发 SMB 解析器在处理时解引用空指针，导致 Ethereal 程序崩溃（拒绝服务）或执行任意代码。攻击无需身份认证，仅需通过网络发送恶意构造的 SMB 流量即可触发，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0401"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:22Z","remediation":"升级 Ethereal 至 0.9.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 SMB 解析器中的空指针解引用问题。如无法升级，可在 Ethereal 设置中禁用 SMB 协议解析器，或使用防火墙规则过滤 SMB 流量（端口 445/TCP 和 139/TCP）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000505","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102268626526119&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-130","http://www.ethereal.com/appnotes/enpa-sa-00004.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9204.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-036.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-088.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4806","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0401.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0401","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0401.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0401.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8fb1620294bff0cde2c82bba8543a916d4f0215c/2002/CVE-2002-0401.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0401.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0401.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0401.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0401.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0401.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0196.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0195","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0195.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0400","title":"ISC BIND 9 DNS 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 9.2.1 之前版本存在拒绝服务漏洞（DoS_findtype）。该漏洞源于 message.c 中 dns_message_findtype() 函数对 rdataset 参数的错误处理缺陷——当该参数不为 NULL 时，函数未能正确处理特定错误条件。攻击者仅需向目标 BIND 服务器发送一个精心构造的畸形 DNS 响应包，即可触发此未处理的错误条件，导致命名服务进程异常终止，造成 DNS 服务中断。该漏洞无需身份认证，远程即可利用，攻击门槛极低，对 DNS 服务可用性造成严重影响。受影响版本包括 BIND 9.0 至 9.2.0 系列，ISC 已在 BIND 9.2.1 版本中修复此问题，用户应尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0400"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:22Z","remediation":"立即将 ISC BIND 9 升级至 9.2.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 dns_message_findtype() 函数对畸形 DNS 报文处理不当导致的拒绝服务问题。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或 iptables 中限制对 DNS 服务端口的访问来源，仅允许可信 IP 段发起 DNS 查询，以降低被攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/hp/2002-q3/0022.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000494","http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:038","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-15.html","http://www.isc.org/index.pl?/sw/bind/bind-security.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9250.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/739123","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_21_bind9.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-105.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-119.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-154.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4936","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0400.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0400","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0400.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/9e840c51f12aff4a18b8c50d63ae898b6e33f403/references/CVE-2002-0400-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0400.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c376806cb2dc05fbeb559b5b1364bc1c095ae81e/2002/CVE-2002-0400.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c3bcb8a007062e69fb258211c3f1efeb5a341535/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0400.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0400.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0400.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0400.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0195.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0190","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0190.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0388","title":"GNU Mailman 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"GNU Mailman 2.0.x 版本在管理员登录页面以及 Pipermail 索引摘要页面中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。由于程序未能对用户输入的内容进行充分的过滤和转义，远程攻击者可通过构造包含恶意脚本的特制请求，诱导管理员访问相关页面，从而在管理员的浏览器上下文中执行任意 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞影响 Mailman 2.0.11 之前的所有版本，可能导致管理员会话被窃取、页面内容被篡改或敏感信息泄露。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0388"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:20Z","remediation":"tags as required.<value>立即升级 GNU Mailman 至 2.0.11 或更高版本，该版本修复了管理员登录页面与 Pipermail 索引摘要中的 XSS 漏洞。升级后，在配置文件 mailman.cfg 中设置 `DEFAULT_URL_PATTERN` 和 `HTML_FILTER_ON` 以启用输入过滤。在完成升级前，可临时禁用 Pipermail 索引摘要功能（修改 `DEFAULT_EMAIL_STYLE` 或移除 `/ Pipermail` 路径映射），并对管理员登录页面的所有用户输入进行 HTML 实体编码，防范恶意脚本注入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mail.python.org/pipermail/mailman-announce/2002-May/000042.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4826","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21480","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0388.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0388","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0388.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0388.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0388.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ba3a5a16133dacbe91f9caa1bbe5a2b5e83a86a7/2002/CVE-2002-0388.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0388.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/de5e978a48281a824409de119a9380c20aa11e39/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0388.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0388.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0388.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0190.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0003","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0380","title":"TCPDump NFS数据包处理缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tcpdump 3.6.2 及更早版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 NFS 网络数据包触发该漏洞，导致 tcpdump 进程崩溃或执行任意代码。攻击无需身份认证，仅需通过网络发送恶意 NFS 数据包即可触发，攻击门槛较低。该漏洞影响 tcpdump 3.6.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0380"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-06-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:19Z","remediation":"升级 tcpdump 至 3.7 或更高版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2002-094/RHSA-2002-121 提供的更新包；Debian 用户安装 DSA-255 安全更新；Caldera OpenLinux 用户安装 CSSA-2002-025.0 补丁。如无法升级，可在网络边界过滤畸形 NFS 数据包作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000491","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102339541014226&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102650721503642&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4169","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-255","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9216.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-094.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-121.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-214.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4890","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0380.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0380","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0380.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0380.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08990b84a65d14f7de760be267bdf98ec816883a/2002/CVE-2002-0380.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0380.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/57b318ad84d91f19df2f11e62567e45db1dd90ad/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0380.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0380.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/e7393e4662b98c582439177871aa2228c548d9c4/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0380.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0380.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0256","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0256.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0311","title":"SCO UnixWare 7.1.1 WebTop 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Caldera UnixWare 7.1.1 和 Open UNIX 8.0.0 的 WebTop 组件中存在任意命令执行漏洞，攻击者可通过向 scoadminreg.cgi 或 service_action.cgi 的 -c 参数注入 Shell 元字符（如管道符、分号等），实现远程命令执行并获取 root 权限。CVSS 评分 10.0，攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需身份认证，可导致系统机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0311"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:11Z","remediation":"立即升级到UnixWare 7.1.1+（包含安全补丁更新）或升级到Open UNIX 8.0.0.2+及以上版本，获取官方发布的SCOAdminReg.cgi和service_action.cgi脚本安全修复包。如无法立即应用补丁，请禁止外部网络访问WebTop管理端口，关闭cgi执行权限，并过滤所有-c参数中的shell元字符作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/251747","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7977.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3936","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21239","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0311.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c5b23a2286aa84c456bf6f6d110b03c6adf1961/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0311.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0311","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0311.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0311.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2e63f84fe8450e46d7b6aec7c8944d58637c73ab/2002/CVE-2002-0311.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0311.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8c9745b793e5195b4aa293353850dc72f712bc1e/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-03xx/CVE-2002-0311.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0311.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0311.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0256.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0256.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0256.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0254","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0254.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0300","title":"GNU GNUJSP 文件泄漏漏洞","description":"GNUJSP 1.0.0 和 1.0.1 版本存在文件泄露漏洞，远程攻击者可直接请求 gnujsp servlet 访问目标文件，该组件未对 JServ 的访问限制进行绕过处理，也未对请求文件进行合法性和权限校验。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特定请求路径，列出服务器目录结构、读取敏感脚本源代码，并绕过应用的访问控制限制，从而获取不该公开的信息。该漏洞影响启用了 GNUJSP 的 Java Servlet 容器环境，CVSS 评分为 5.0，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0300"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:10Z","remediation":"立即升级GNUJSP至1.1或更高版本，修复文件披露漏洞。在Web服务器中配置访问控制，阻止对/servlets/gnujsp/路径的直接请求，修复允许绕过.htaccess的配置错误。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101415804625292&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101422432123898&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-114","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8240.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4125","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21295","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d856f6c74dc5fe460